WEBVTT

00:09.360 --> 00:13.070
The labels are burnt,
but the contents are okay.

00:13.070 --> 00:14.780
I'm so sorry. I'm so, so sorry.

00:15.170 --> 00:16.620
It's all right.

00:16.620 --> 00:18.720
You've been apologizing all morning.

00:18.720 --> 00:21.500
It's okay. Even this can't bring me down.

00:22.030 --> 00:24.110
I'm impressed, though.

00:24.110 --> 00:26.840
I can't believe three little girls did this.

00:28.900 --> 00:32.390
Hey, don't be rude to the lady!

00:33.140 --> 00:34.530
Don't let it get to you.

00:34.530 --> 00:37.910
They're just jealous because
men can't use magic.

00:40.530 --> 00:43.140
A path leading away from knowledge.

00:43.930 --> 00:46.810
A path leading away from strength.

00:47.550 --> 00:51.400
From one beginning comes a parting of ways, never to meet again.

00:52.280 --> 00:58.160
Those with knowledge seek those with
strength with the light of destiny.

02:21.590 --> 02:24.990
You'll Become Obsessed!

02:41.410 --> 02:42.740
Good morning...

02:43.510 --> 02:45.140
What are you doing in my bed?

02:45.550 --> 02:48.680
Don't you know it gets cold in
the mornings and evenings?

02:48.680 --> 02:50.400
The evening dew is ridiculous.

02:50.400 --> 02:53.180
Anyway, what a fluffy bed.

02:53.180 --> 02:55.460
Why are you in my bed?

02:57.970 --> 03:00.110
Because I'm interested in you, of course.

03:01.530 --> 03:04.850
Please join the Aquafall Defense!

03:05.300 --> 03:07.470
Currently recruiting brave young people!

03:07.470 --> 03:10.280
You don't get paid,
but protecting the planet...

03:10.280 --> 03:12.500
...will earn you greater popularity
than you could ever buy!

03:12.860 --> 03:13.750
I'm not interested.

03:14.140 --> 03:16.000
I like things the way they are now.

03:18.300 --> 03:21.760
What are you going to do
if this town is in danger?

03:21.760 --> 03:24.160
You won't be able to sleep in your fluffy bed.

03:24.160 --> 03:26.060
I'll be totally fine.

03:27.220 --> 03:30.810
My mage father will protect me.

03:32.780 --> 03:35.570
Are you sure about that?

03:36.100 --> 03:38.820
Apparently, they've never
seen a bug like it before.

03:39.360 --> 03:42.990
We should assume they're
approaching our town, as well.

03:43.530 --> 03:47.080
Once the reconnaissance team
returns, we'll know even more.

03:47.790 --> 03:50.230
We can't tell the public until then.

03:50.800 --> 03:52.600
Instead of waiting for the report,

03:52.600 --> 03:54.670
we should form our own
countermeasures, as well.

03:55.530 --> 03:59.040
Shall I call the youngsters
and start a discussion?

03:59.590 --> 04:00.520
Yes.

04:01.920 --> 04:03.930
By the way, about yesterday's commotion...

04:04.320 --> 04:06.470
Your daughter seems to have been there.

04:07.710 --> 04:09.120
It's embarrassing...

04:09.550 --> 04:11.940
She's still an unruly child...

04:12.330 --> 04:14.940
I will scold her firmly.

04:15.160 --> 04:18.210
This feels so good.

04:18.210 --> 04:20.940
I've never done anything like this before.

04:22.370 --> 04:24.780
Oh, that stings a little bit.

04:24.780 --> 04:27.170
Please be gentle.

04:32.280 --> 04:36.470
What's this? You look like a princess.

04:37.240 --> 04:38.240
Here.

04:38.240 --> 04:42.010
What? You already finished
cleaning my clothes?

04:42.010 --> 04:43.940
What kind of magic is this?!

04:43.940 --> 04:46.550
Please, no more! This is too amazing!

04:46.550 --> 04:48.260
What kind of life is this?

04:48.260 --> 04:49.830
How can you be so bourgeois?

04:50.320 --> 04:52.670
We're having delicious food
first thing in the morning.

04:52.670 --> 04:54.760
I don't have to hold back, right?

04:57.460 --> 05:00.400
Oh, please leave the whole basket of bread.

05:01.450 --> 05:03.150
And I'd like some more soup, please.

05:03.410 --> 05:04.770
Very well.

05:05.720 --> 05:06.840
Hooray!

05:07.810 --> 05:09.440
You sure eat a lot.

05:09.440 --> 05:12.450
It's a mystery how it all fits inside that body.

05:13.680 --> 05:15.010
Oh, Father!

05:15.780 --> 05:17.280
Good morning.

05:17.830 --> 05:21.160
Good morning, Bahamut.
You're smiling wonderfully today.

05:21.680 --> 05:24.100
I've been eating with our guest.

05:24.630 --> 05:29.300
That's fine. Introduce me to your cute friend.

05:30.690 --> 05:33.020
Cute? How honest of you.

05:33.430 --> 05:35.320
She isn't my friend.

05:35.320 --> 05:37.260
In fact, she's a trespasser.

05:37.260 --> 05:38.970
You're so mean! Of course we're friends!

05:38.970 --> 05:40.120
No, we're not!

05:40.120 --> 05:41.760
I spoke with the marshal.

05:42.310 --> 05:44.700
He told me the Key Tail was destroyed.

05:45.870 --> 05:47.330
How did it happen?

05:48.160 --> 05:53.370
Well, there was a girl in trouble,
and I couldn't ignore her...

05:53.730 --> 05:54.970
I see.

05:55.730 --> 05:58.620
Father, that's only what ended up happening.

05:58.620 --> 06:00.380
It certainly wasn't on purpose.

06:00.830 --> 06:05.880
Bahamut, the people of the town need to be able to eat at that tavern.

06:06.370 --> 06:09.010
Yes. I'm sorry, Father.

06:10.260 --> 06:12.990
But I can't believe you destroyed it.

06:13.780 --> 06:16.640
Even for my daughter,
that was some impressive magic.

06:17.290 --> 06:19.270
It wasn't good of you to destroy the tavern,

06:19.800 --> 06:22.720
but you seem to have
improved your skills again.

06:22.720 --> 06:24.020
I'm pleased.

06:30.210 --> 06:31.810
He's crazy for his kid...

06:37.890 --> 06:40.230
You look like a fairy when you do that.

06:40.230 --> 06:41.540
I am a fairy!

06:41.860 --> 06:43.590
I brought you some tea.

06:45.020 --> 06:46.540
I've been waiting for that!

06:46.540 --> 06:49.000
After all you've already eaten,
you're still eating more?

06:49.510 --> 06:51.470
What's going on inside your body?

06:51.790 --> 06:55.490
I don't know, but I don't think I've ever felt full.

06:56.360 --> 06:57.760
Let's test it, then.

06:57.760 --> 07:00.070
It doesn't matter what it is, just keep it coming!

07:00.070 --> 07:01.310
Very well.

07:01.710 --> 07:03.810
What? You're giving me more?

07:05.530 --> 07:07.160
This is interesting.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.720
There's no limit to how much she can fit.

07:10.850 --> 07:12.200
Father!

07:13.520 --> 07:17.420
Father, come here. I've found
something very interesting!

07:17.420 --> 07:18.330
I'm sorry.

07:19.790 --> 07:21.940
I've got an important meeting.

07:21.940 --> 07:23.500
You'll have to tell me later.

07:26.100 --> 07:27.500
Okay!

07:37.160 --> 07:41.110
My father is a very important
mage in this town.

07:41.110 --> 07:42.520
Isn't that amazing?

07:44.600 --> 07:46.670
That's why he's always busy.

07:51.160 --> 07:53.780
We should be able to open now.

07:54.190 --> 07:56.000
Thanks for your help.

07:56.900 --> 07:59.470
Okay, everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

07:59.470 --> 08:01.840
The Key Tail is open for business again!

08:04.900 --> 08:07.250
You're pretty good.

08:08.960 --> 08:10.860
W-Well, yeah.

08:10.860 --> 08:14.100
I've been playing with my
father since I was little.

08:14.100 --> 08:16.760
But you're no match for me.

08:18.740 --> 08:19.990
Checkmate.

08:21.640 --> 08:23.520
Do you surrender?

08:26.840 --> 08:28.400
Leave it to me.

08:28.400 --> 08:31.090
We'll drive them off easily with our magic.

08:31.510 --> 08:34.570
We don't know how strong they are yet.

08:34.570 --> 08:35.620
Just watch.

08:35.620 --> 08:37.540
My father will know how to handle this.

08:37.540 --> 08:38.810
Really? Interesting.

08:38.810 --> 08:39.900
Father!

08:40.330 --> 08:44.790
I'm sorry, Bahamut. I need to go out now.

08:46.730 --> 08:49.990
Play with your cute friend at home today.

09:00.730 --> 09:03.330
Hey, what's gotten into you?

09:03.330 --> 09:05.020
Let's play chess at home.

09:05.330 --> 09:06.890
No more chess.

09:06.890 --> 09:09.900
Why don't we eat, then?
I wouldn't mind a snack.

09:10.260 --> 09:13.210
No more food. No snacks either.

09:13.210 --> 09:14.610
What? What not?!

09:14.610 --> 09:15.770
Shut up!

09:20.140 --> 09:22.080
Water, please.

09:22.630 --> 09:23.950
Yes, right away.

09:26.890 --> 09:29.230
Here's your fried Gegeru.

09:29.230 --> 09:33.410
Could I get a stewed red lizard and a tail salad?

09:33.750 --> 09:36.180
Yes. Barkeep, two orders in!

09:36.820 --> 09:39.090
One stewed lizard, one salad.

09:39.390 --> 09:40.430
Okay.

09:41.210 --> 09:43.810
The pasta and wrap are up, so take them out.

09:43.810 --> 09:44.540
Okay.

09:45.410 --> 09:46.730
Hey, miss. Where's my water?

09:46.990 --> 09:48.170
Okay!

09:48.960 --> 09:50.760
Water, come.

09:57.200 --> 09:58.860
Oh, I'm sorry!

10:04.460 --> 10:06.330
Even my scales are soaked.

10:06.620 --> 10:07.920
Leviatan!

10:10.670 --> 10:14.340
Leviatan, you can't use your magic for this!

10:14.790 --> 10:16.960
I-I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

10:22.420 --> 10:25.160
I think this is my first time coming this far...

10:25.160 --> 10:27.220
We're not lost, okay.

10:28.510 --> 10:30.280
Syrop...

10:30.730 --> 10:34.020
Syrop, you're around, right?

10:37.680 --> 10:40.470
Oh, come on! This isn't my fault!

10:40.470 --> 10:42.030
It's your own fault you're so inconsiderate!

10:46.100 --> 10:47.520
Is that you, Syrop?

10:48.140 --> 10:49.870
Oh, there you are.

10:49.870 --> 10:52.790
I won't take back calling you inconsiderate.

11:04.080 --> 11:05.140
Go away!

11:05.590 --> 11:08.000
Go away, go away!

11:23.930 --> 11:26.410
That was scary. What were those?

11:26.830 --> 11:27.520
Huh?

11:30.220 --> 11:31.760
Wh-What is this?

11:31.760 --> 11:33.410
Huh? What?

11:33.410 --> 11:34.420
It won't come out!

11:35.160 --> 11:38.140
Someone help me!

11:39.460 --> 11:42.430
Help!

11:43.400 --> 11:44.800
That voice...

11:49.790 --> 11:52.010
It came from over here...

11:55.550 --> 11:58.330
Uh, did you scream?

11:58.700 --> 11:59.480
Yeah.

12:00.040 --> 12:01.960
What are you doing here?

12:01.960 --> 12:03.250
Can't you tell?

12:03.250 --> 12:04.620
I'm stuck in this swamp.

12:05.010 --> 12:05.990
A swamp?

12:11.810 --> 12:13.010
You're sinking.

12:13.490 --> 12:14.780
Yes, I'm sinking.

12:15.370 --> 12:16.940
You can't get out?

12:16.940 --> 12:19.380
I screamed because I couldn't get out!

12:19.380 --> 12:21.310
Don't just stand there, help me!

12:21.310 --> 12:25.710
You angrily ran off and got yourself stuck in a bottomless swamp...

12:30.960 --> 12:32.930
Don't laugh. Help me.

12:33.340 --> 12:34.310
Okay.

12:37.280 --> 12:40.190
More! More, more!

12:40.190 --> 12:41.200
More!

12:41.200 --> 12:43.270
Pull harder!

12:46.950 --> 12:49.560
That's it! Just like that!

12:49.560 --> 12:51.570
I can't, I'm at my limit.

12:59.910 --> 13:01.560
I did my best.

13:01.560 --> 13:03.800
You look perfectly fine to me!

13:03.800 --> 13:06.970
You were so close! Why did you give up?

13:06.970 --> 13:08.790
I'm stuck even deeper than before!

13:08.790 --> 13:11.600
What? I gave it everything I had.

13:11.600 --> 13:12.840
I'm out of fuel.

13:12.840 --> 13:14.980
How inefficient can you be?!

13:15.570 --> 13:17.790
I know! Why don't you transform?

13:18.500 --> 13:20.980
Then you'll be able to fly away on your own.

13:21.280 --> 13:22.680
Oh, right.

13:22.680 --> 13:25.000
That didn't occur to me at all.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.260
You're an idiot.

13:55.430 --> 13:57.230
You're kidding!

13:57.590 --> 13:59.350
What am I going to do?!

13:59.350 --> 14:00.900
This isn't good.

14:01.440 --> 14:03.150
I can't fly...

14:04.180 --> 14:05.620
Help me...

14:06.150 --> 14:08.910
Help me, please!

14:09.590 --> 14:11.800
I'll go get your father.

14:11.800 --> 14:12.390
Wait here.

14:12.390 --> 14:13.370
No!

14:13.660 --> 14:15.340
Not my father!

14:15.340 --> 14:17.810
I don't want him to see me like this!

14:17.810 --> 14:19.530
But this is an emergency.

14:19.530 --> 14:21.110
You're such a pain.

14:21.110 --> 14:23.680
This might take some time.

14:23.680 --> 14:24.920
Hurry!

14:24.920 --> 14:27.460
Yes, okay.

14:36.730 --> 14:39.730
I ruined the shop again...

14:47.880 --> 14:50.070
I'm so hungry.

14:52.930 --> 14:55.870
Hey, I heard the Key Tail
is open for business again.

14:57.210 --> 14:59.410
No, not yet...

15:00.340 --> 15:01.910
Oh, well.

15:02.330 --> 15:05.090
I guess that beef bowl will have to wait again.

15:12.170 --> 15:12.990
That's...

15:12.990 --> 15:15.060
The fairy!

15:15.550 --> 15:17.680
It's that fairy from yesterday!

15:18.360 --> 15:19.630
Syrop!

15:20.160 --> 15:24.050
A name as sweet and cute as
mine can be memorized instantly!

15:24.050 --> 15:25.910
Sorry.

15:25.910 --> 15:28.120
You seem to be in a hurry. What's wrong?

15:28.620 --> 15:29.990
Oh! Right, right.

15:29.990 --> 15:31.330
That's what's important.

15:31.330 --> 15:33.140
Come with me immediately.

15:33.140 --> 15:35.380
Bahamut is... Bahamut is...

15:38.430 --> 15:39.410
Huh?

15:39.860 --> 15:41.280
Bahamut...

15:42.090 --> 15:42.710
Who's that?

15:43.740 --> 15:44.680
What?

15:46.180 --> 15:47.500
Hurry...

15:47.500 --> 15:49.270
Save me, quickly...

15:49.840 --> 15:51.220
Father!

15:51.850 --> 15:53.720
This way! Hurry!

15:54.870 --> 15:56.060
Bahamut!

15:58.330 --> 15:59.730
From yesterday...

16:00.030 --> 16:02.060
You came to save me.

16:05.230 --> 16:06.920
Right? It's just like you told me.

16:07.340 --> 16:08.990
What do you think I told you?

16:08.990 --> 16:13.250
I told you to go get people
to help me, not laugh at me!

16:13.250 --> 16:14.740
You idiot!

16:16.320 --> 16:17.980
Sorry, I couldn't help it.

16:18.480 --> 16:22.220
It's okay, I brought you help.

16:22.740 --> 16:27.590
I even cleared your condition
of not bringing your father.

16:29.940 --> 16:32.080
If you move around, you'll sink even deeper.

16:32.080 --> 16:33.510
You should hold still.

16:33.950 --> 16:36.500
Wait here. I'll find you something to grab onto.

16:38.260 --> 16:39.920
Grab onto this!

16:51.930 --> 16:54.030
I missed.

16:54.030 --> 16:56.030
My mistake.

16:56.270 --> 16:58.170
What are you, stupid?!

16:58.170 --> 17:00.700
I thought it would work like a life preserver.

17:00.700 --> 17:02.060
That was close, wasn't it?

17:02.060 --> 17:03.560
That was really close!

17:05.780 --> 17:06.890
This is it...

17:10.760 --> 17:12.160
Grab onto this!

17:12.550 --> 17:14.300
I'll hold you!

17:14.800 --> 17:15.550
Okay.

17:16.010 --> 17:17.410
Just a little more...

17:17.410 --> 17:18.470
You can do it!

17:19.210 --> 17:21.080
A little more...

17:21.800 --> 17:24.480
I'm not even close to reaching...

17:26.350 --> 17:27.960
This isn't good.

17:28.380 --> 17:30.150
Yeah, really.

17:30.150 --> 17:32.530
Do you have any ideas?

17:33.720 --> 17:36.350
Hey, you're an amazing water user, right?

17:37.270 --> 17:39.150
A swamp is a kind of lake.

17:39.150 --> 17:41.730
You can save her with your magic.

17:42.230 --> 17:44.410
That sounds like a good idea. Let's do it!

17:54.540 --> 17:56.110
Water, respond.

18:05.110 --> 18:06.520
Looking good.

18:08.880 --> 18:11.010
The mud is making huge waves.

18:11.010 --> 18:13.520
Your magic truly is amazing.

18:14.780 --> 18:16.070
She sank.

18:29.650 --> 18:32.080
Oh, good, Bahamut. Are you okay?

18:34.760 --> 18:37.620
What is this? What's going on?

20:12.670 --> 25:00.000
Next Episode

20:15.670 --> 25:00.000
I'll Go Deep!
